y-lg text-display-lg text-on-surface max-w-2xl tracking-tight\">Koleksi Tools AI TugasMu</h1><p class=\"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl mt-3\">Pilih asisten pintar sesuai mata pelajaran dan kebutuhan tugas harianmu. Cepat, akurat, dan gratis.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mt-6 px-space-lg py-2 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex -space-x-2\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center justify-center ring-2 ring-surface-container-lowest\">SD</div><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-secondary text-on-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center justify-center ring-2 ring-surface-container-lowest\">SMP</div><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-tertiary text-on-tertiary font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center justify-center ring-2 ring-surface-container-lowest\">SMA</div></div><span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">Terverifikasi sesuai <strong class=\"text-on-surface font-semibold\">Kurikulum Merdeka</strong> &amp; standar Kemendikbudristek</span></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm mb-10 flex flex-col gap-5\"><div class=\"relative w-full\"><div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-4 flex items-center pointer-events-none text-outline\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">search</span></div><input class=\"w-full h-12 pl-11 pr-28 bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl text-on-surface placeholder:text-outline font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:shadow-[0_0_0_2px_#0ea5e9,0_0_10px_rgba(14,165,233,0.15)] transition-all\" id=\"toolSearchInput\" placeholder=\"Cari tool (misal: Parafrase, Rumus Fisika, Essay Inggris)...\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-2 flex items-center\"><span class=\"px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm rounded-lg flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">keyboard</span>Ctrl + K</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"category-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md transition-all active:scale-[0.98] bg-primary-container text-on-primary shadow-sm\">Semua (8)</button><button class=\"category-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md transition-all active:scale-[0.98] bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-high\">Bahasa &amp; Sastra (3)</button><button class=\"category-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md transition-all active:scale-[0.98] bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-high\">Matematika &amp; IPA (3)</button><button class=\"category-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md transition-all active:scale-[0.98] bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-high\">Penyusun Rangkuman (2)</button><button class=\"category-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md transition-all active:scale-[0.98] bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-high\">Latihan Ujian (2)</button></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 self-stretch sm:self-auto pt-2 lg:pt-0\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-tertiary\">local_fire_department</span><span>Paling Populer</span></button><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md transition-colors bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary\">verified</span><span>Kurikulum Merdeka</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6 px-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface\">Daftar Generator &amp; Pemecah Masalah</span><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm\">30<!-- --> Tools Aktif</span></div><div class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary inline-block\"></span><span>Semua tool beroperasi normal (SLA 99.9%)</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"tool-card group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm transition-colors bg-primary-fixed text-primary group-hover:bg-primary-container group-hover:text-on-primary\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\">checklist_rtl</span></div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&#x27;FILL&#x27; 1\">local_fire_department</span>Terpopuler</span></div><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-bold\">Ujian &amp; Latihan</span><h2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mt-1 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Generator Soal &amp; Kuis</h2><p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-3 mb-4\">Buat paket soal pilihan ganda atau esai materi SD hingga SMA lengkap dengan kunci jawaban dan pembahasan rinci.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 mt-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline mb-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-primary\">group</span>18.4<!-- -->k digunakan</span><span class=\"text-secondary font-bold\">99% Akurat</span></div><a class=\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm transition-all active:scale-[0.98]\" href=\"/tools/generator-soal\"><span>Gunakan Tool</span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">arrow_forward</span></a></div></div><div class=\"tool-card group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm transition-colors bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container group-hover:bg-secondary group-hover:text-on-secondary\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\">edit_note</span></div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&#x27;FILL&#x27; 1\">local_fire_department</span>Rekomendasi</span></div><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-bold\">Bahasa &amp; Makalah</span><h2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mt-1 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Parafrase Teks &amp; Makalah</h2><p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-3 mb-4\">Ubah susunan kalimat tugas agar terdengar natural, santun, dan lolos uji orisinalitas tanpa mengubah inti materi.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 mt-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline mb-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-primary\">group</span>14.2<!-- -->k digunakan</span><span class=\"text-secondary font-bold\">Lolos Turnitin</span></div><a class=\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm transition-all active:scale-[0.98]\" href=\"/tools/parafrase\"><span>Gunakan Tool</span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">arrow_forward</span></a></div></div><div class=\"tool-card group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm transition-colors bg-primary-fixed text-primary group-hover:bg-primary-container group-hover:text-on-primary\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\">subject</span></div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&#x27;FILL&#x27; 1\">local_fire_department</span>Ringkas PDF/Buku</span></div><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-bold\">Belajar Cepat</span><h2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mt-1 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Rangkuman Materi &amp; Bab</h2><p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-3 mb-4\">Ringkas bab buku cetak tebal, PDF materi guru, atau artikel panjang menjadi poin-poin hafalan dalam hitungan detik.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 mt-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline mb-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-primary\">group</span>12.8<!-- -->k digunakan</span><span class=\"text-secondary font-bold\">Instant Bullets</span></div><a class=\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm transition-all active:scale-[0.98]\" href=\"/tools/rangkuman\"><span>Gunakan Tool</span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">arrow_forward</span></a></div></div><div class=\"tool-card group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm transition-colors bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface group-hover:bg-primary-container group-hover:text-on-primary\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\">calculate</span></div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&#x27;FILL&#x27; 1\">local_fire_department</span>Step-by-Step</span></div><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-bold\">Eksakta</span><h2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mt-1 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Solver Rumus Matematika &amp; IPA</h2><p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-3 mb-4\">Ketik atau tempel soal hitungan fisika, kimia, matematika. Dapatkan langkah penjabaran rumus tahap demi tahap.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 mt-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline mb-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-primary\">group</span>11.5<!-- -->k digunakan</span><span class=\"text-secondary font-bold\">LateX Ready</span></div><a class=\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm transition-all active:scale-[0.98]\" href=\"/tools/solver-rumus\"><span>Gunakan Tool</span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">arrow_forward</span></a></div></div><div class=\"tool-card group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm transition-colors bg-tertiary-fixed text-tertiary group-hover:bg-tertiary-container group-hover:text-on-tertiary\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\">spellcheck</span></div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1\">SD - SMA</span></div><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-bold\">Bahasa Asing</span><h2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mt-1 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Korektor Grammar &amp; Essay Inggris</h2><p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-3 mb-4\">Cek tata bahasa tulisan esai bahasa Inggris, perkaya kosakata formal, dan dapatkan saran revisi instan.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 mt-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline mb-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-primary\">group</span>8.9<!-- -->k digunakan</span><span class=\"text-secondary font-bold\">CEFR A1-C1</span></div><a class=\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm transition-all active:scale-[0.98]\" href=\"/tools/grammar-checker\"><span>Gunakan Tool</span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">arrow_forward</span></a></div></div><div class=\"tool-card group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm transition-colors bg-surface-container text-on-surface group-hover:bg-primary-container group-hover:text-on-primary\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\">draw</span></div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1\">Kreatif</span></div><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-bold\">Seni &amp; Bahasa</span><h2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mt-1 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Pembuat Pantun &amp; Sastra</h2><p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-3 mb-4\">Hasilkan pantun nasihat, pantun jenaka rima a-b-a-b, atau bait puisi berima indah untuk tugas seni budaya.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 mt-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline mb-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-primary\">group</s