adow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm transition-colors bg-surface-container text-on-surface group-hover:bg-primary-container group-hover:text-on-primary\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\">mosque</span></div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1\">Sekolah Islam</span></div><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-bold\">Madrasah &amp; Ponpes</span><h2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mt-1 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Generator Materi PAI (Fikih/SKI)</h2><p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-3 mb-4\">Buat rangkuman materi spesifik Fikih, Aqidah Akhlak, atau Sejarah Kebudayaan Islam.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 mt-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline mb-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-primary\">group</span>0.0<!-- -->k digunakan</span><span class=\"text-secondary font-bold\">Aqidah Fikih</span></div><a class=\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm transition-all active:scale-[0.98]\" href=\"/tools/materi-pai\"><span>Gunakan Tool</span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">arrow_forward</span></a></div></div><div class=\"tool-card group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm transition-colors bg-surface-container text-on-surface group-hover:bg-primary-container group-hover:text-on-primary\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\">record_voice_over</span></div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1\">Tahsin</span></div><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-bold\">Madrasah &amp; Ponpes</span><h2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mt-1 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Penjelas Ilmu Tajwid &amp; Tahsin</h2><p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-3 mb-4\">Analisis hukum bacaan tajwid pada potongan ayat (Idgham, Ikhfa, Mad, dll) beserta cara bacanya.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 mt-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline mb-3\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-primary\">group</span>0.0<!-- -->k digunakan</span><span class=\"text-secondary font-bold\">Hukum Bacaan</span></div><a class=\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md shadow-sm transition-all active:scale-[0.98]\" href=\"/tools/tajwid\"><span>Gunakan Tool</span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">arrow_forward</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-14 mb-10 bg-[#fffbeb] rounded-xl p-space-lg md:p-space-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#fef3c7] text-[#92400e] flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\">psychology_alt</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-fu